Pillow Lanczos algorithm source:
ImageScaleDown's Torch Lanczos-3 implementation adapts Pillow's filter,
half-pixel sample bounds, scale-dependent support, and boundary normalization.
Pillow also supplies the development-only floating-point numerical reference.

